      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 7.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Right then, come on in. Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.3,
      "end_seconds": 15.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Oh, uh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.5,
      "end_seconds": 18.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.17,
      "end_seconds": 37.43,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "I wanted to get three early losses looked at i'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me a neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.49,
      "end_seconds": 43.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.9,
      "end_seconds": 63.87,
      "duration_seconds": 18.97,
      "text": "I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. It's spironolactone, 25 milligrams, once a day for my heart. I do miss it now and then, to be fair. It's folic acid, 400 micrograms, daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.07,
      "end_seconds": 66.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.25,
      "end_seconds": 86.91,
      "duration_seconds": 18.66,
      "text": "Yeah, I'd say about three months. Actually, no, closer to six months. Oh, I've been feeling low and anxious too, for about three months. And there's irregular cycles as well, two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.68,
      "end_seconds": 93.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Have you had three early losses before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.08,
      "end_seconds": 100.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "uh, I had a similar thing last winter it went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.72,
      "end_seconds": 108.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "let me check a few things any fever, heavy bleeding now or clotting problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.14,
      "end_seconds": 118.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "okay, so I haven't had fever, heavy bleeding now or clotting problem, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.18,
      "end_seconds": 123.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Have you had pain, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.35,
      "end_seconds": 127.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No, no pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.66,
      "end_seconds": 130.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.24,
      "end_seconds": 134.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, uh, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.61,
      "end_seconds": 151.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.99,
      "end_seconds": 157.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.66,
      "end_seconds": 159.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Alright, have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.62,
      "end_seconds": 165.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.57,
      "end_seconds": 168.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.5,
      "end_seconds": 174.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.87,
      "end_seconds": 189.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.27,
      "end_seconds": 193.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.43,
      "end_seconds": 199.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.61,
      "end_seconds": 204.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I have heart disease, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.39,
      "end_seconds": 207.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.57,
      "end_seconds": 210.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "yes, heart failure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.51,
      "end_seconds": 217.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "yes i'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.9,
      "end_seconds": 233.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.38,
      "end_seconds": 265.35,
      "duration_seconds": 12.97,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.8 degrees, BP is 112 over 73. And pulse is 77 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.68,
      "end_seconds": 284.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Listening to the whole story, this is probably recurrent miscarriage needing investigation. An antiphospholipid problem is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.0,
      "end_seconds": 287.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.52,
      "end_seconds": 314.93,
      "duration_seconds": 25.41,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now recurrent miscarriage needing investigation is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with recurrent miscarriage. We will arrange specialist care so the next pregnancy is looked after from the start. Let's get you seen by the recurrent miscarriage clinic, I'll arrange the letter. I'd like you back after the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.65,
      "end_seconds": 318.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.94,
      "end_seconds": 328.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.51,
      "end_seconds": 333.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.95,
      "end_seconds": 341.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "So, take care now."
    }
  ]
